Description: "The `PIFDataModel` package provides tools to manage, validate, 
              and document JSON schemas in R. It is designed to streamline the
              organization of structured data, particularly for biological and 
              environmental datasets. The package includes a collection of 
              predefined schemas and structs for common use cases,
              such as bacteria count data, along with functions to read, 
              validate, and visualize JSON data. By ensuring consistency and
              interoperability, `PIFDataModel` facilitates data-driven 
              research and simplifies the integration of structured data into R workflows.""
